 "merzouga-buggy-tour.html": "        <li><article class=\"htour\"><a class=\"htour__link\" href=\"merzouga-buggy-tour.html\">\n            <span class=\"htour__media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/merzouga-buggy-dunes.jpg\" alt=\"Merzouga Buggy Tour\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"htour__days\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12l3 2\"/></svg>1–2 hours</span></span>\n            <span class=\"htour__body\">\n              <h3 class=\"htour__title\">Merzouga Buggy Tour</h3>\n              <span class=\"htour__stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 17l-5.2 2.6 1-5.8L3.5 9.7l5.9-.9z\"/></svg></span>\n              <p class=\"htour__desc\">Drive a buggy side by side across the Erg Chebbi dunes behind your guide; nomad tea and the desert lake on the 2-hour ride.</p>\n              <span class=\"htour__facts\">\n                <span class=\"htour__fact\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hid